WEBVTT

01:30.710 --> 01:31.690
He's late.

01:32.580 --> 01:36.490
Akutsu has some nerve, making me wait.

01:39.140 --> 01:40.570
You're late!

01:40.570 --> 01:42.580
You were supposed to be here five 
minutes before the scheduled time!

01:43.040 --> 01:44.540
Sorry.

01:44.540 --> 01:46.110
We're bored over here.

01:46.110 --> 01:48.210
Wanna go hang?

01:48.600 --> 01:51.550
I-I'm waiting for someone.

01:51.550 --> 01:52.800
So cute!

01:52.800 --> 01:55.850
Wanna go have some tea 
until your friend gets here?

01:55.850 --> 01:57.720
We know this area really well.

01:57.720 --> 02:00.540
<i>Shoot, I encouraged them.</i>

02:00.540 --> 02:02.100
Cut it out, guys.

02:03.620 --> 02:06.140
You've made her uncomfortable.

02:06.480 --> 02:09.500
Ask her out so forcefully, and she'll break.

02:10.000 --> 02:13.500
A girl is like a microscope slide.

02:15.540 --> 02:17.100
It's a cool bro!

02:17.100 --> 02:19.450
I have no idea what
he's talking about, though!

02:21.110 --> 02:22.780
Sorry to keep you waiting.

02:23.410 --> 02:26.450
It's in a hero's nature to arrive late.

02:26.890 --> 02:28.580
Enough of that!

02:28.580 --> 02:30.960
She's kinda scary!

02:31.620 --> 02:33.520
That hurt.

02:33.520 --> 02:35.470
Come on, I helped you out.

02:35.470 --> 02:37.050
Shut it.

02:37.050 --> 02:39.740
That green elephant was crying.

02:39.740 --> 02:41.210
Poor thing.

02:41.210 --> 02:43.850
You squashed it, like, <i>this</i> small.

02:44.290 --> 02:47.270
Want me to do the same thing to you?

02:47.270 --> 02:48.420
Huh?

02:50.720 --> 02:53.110
Wh-What?

02:53.720 --> 02:55.980
You came quite prepared.

02:55.980 --> 02:57.310
Your outfit and stuff.

02:57.310 --> 03:00.280
I-I don't go out with people very often.

03:00.280 --> 03:02.070
I didn't know how far to take it.

03:03.870 --> 03:05.700
<b>Staaare</b>

03:06.560 --> 03:10.040
S-Stop staring like that.

03:12.480 --> 03:13.960
You pervert.

03:15.600 --> 03:17.680
No, I was just surprised!

03:17.680 --> 03:20.950
You're just so fluffy, I thought 
you might be like last time...

03:21.220 --> 03:25.140
It's too heavy! I can't carry it!

03:21.540 --> 03:25.140
<i>It's too heavy! I can't carry it!</i>

03:25.140 --> 03:29.140
You were pretty fluffy 
that time, too, but now...

03:29.140 --> 03:31.770
I won't hear any more of it.

03:32.140 --> 03:34.900
If you bring that up again...

03:36.320 --> 03:42.700
On your way to school, during class, 
during break time, and...

03:42.700 --> 03:44.280
And?

03:44.280 --> 03:49.850
at the monthly school assembly, you'll feel 
the wrath of the collar on your neck!

03:45.780 --> 03:46.530
<b>Hahahaha</b>

03:48.080 --> 03:48.790
<b>Hahahaha</b>

03:49.850 --> 03:53.500
We might get to see an erotic love scene 
between you and our homeroom teacher

03:50.370 --> 03:51.040
<b>Hahahaha</b>

03:52.750 --> 03:53.290
<b>Hahahaha</b>

03:53.500 --> 03:55.290
first thing in the morning!

03:54.830 --> 03:55.290
<b>Hahahaha</b>

03:56.680 --> 03:57.930
Sensei...

03:57.930 --> 03:58.920
No!

03:58.920 --> 04:00.340
People are watching!

04:00.620 --> 04:02.780
I-I'm sorry.

04:02.780 --> 04:05.050
Now, then, shall we get going?

04:05.340 --> 04:07.270
It's time to hunt demons.

04:07.270 --> 04:08.180
Right.

04:09.600 --> 04:12.120
Let's see how many I can hunt down!

04:13.060 --> 04:17.690
<i>In other words, she's going to 
exorcise my compatriots.</i>

04:18.530 --> 04:21.540
<i>Cooperating with her 
is a serious act of treason.</i>

04:21.540 --> 04:23.610
<i>I'll be in deep trouble if I'm caught.</i>

04:24.360 --> 04:27.180
<i>But right now, I have no ability to refuse.</i>

04:27.180 --> 04:29.790
<i>All I can do is hope we don't meet anyone.</i>

04:30.160 --> 04:32.750
So, where are we going?

04:34.230 --> 04:35.390
Here.

04:35.390 --> 04:36.700
Stray dogs?

04:36.700 --> 04:41.050
There are a lot of reports lately of people 
being attacked by stray dogs around here.

04:41.050 --> 04:44.410
And the victims are all women.

04:44.820 --> 04:47.680
Don't you think there's a good 
chance a demon is to blame?

04:48.150 --> 04:49.880
I'm not so sure.

04:49.880 --> 04:52.640
Even if it's a demon, how do we find it?

04:52.640 --> 04:55.810
The city published a case map on the website.

04:55.810 --> 04:58.770
Panda Coffee

04:55.810 --> 04:59.270
Juumart

04:55.810 --> 05:00.020
Post Office

04:55.810 --> 05:01.070
Kids' Park

04:55.810 --> 05:01.780
Tawson

04:55.810 --> 05:01.780
Kitsune




Acupuncture

04:56.160 --> 04:57.660
I see.

04:57.660 --> 05:01.780
So, how far away can you detect a demon?

04:57.860 --> 05:01.780
Yatsubishi Bank






Mutsunomiya Branch

04:58.690 --> 05:01.570
Souma





Building

05:02.930 --> 05:04.750
Depends on who they are, I guess.

05:04.750 --> 05:08.160
If they're powerful, I should notice 
them even if they're far away.

05:08.770 --> 05:11.500
As long as they aren't hiding it 
or suppressing their power.

05:11.500 --> 05:15.290
In other words, if it's a weak demon, 
we'll need to be close first.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.330
Well, then, I guess you're not that useful.

05:18.330 --> 05:20.170
Don't say it like that!

05:23.040 --> 05:24.130
What is it?

05:25.890 --> 05:27.130
Is it over there?

05:28.410 --> 05:30.620
No. It's not that.

05:31.750 --> 05:35.320
Just so you know, you aren't going 
to be able to keep any secrets from me.

05:35.320 --> 05:37.100
I know that.

05:42.570 --> 05:45.180
It's not so easy finding demons, huh?

05:45.180 --> 05:46.900
By the way...

05:47.410 --> 05:49.480
Haven't you had enough to eat?

05:49.480 --> 05:51.080
Nonsense.

05:51.080 --> 05:54.480
The search takes a lot of energy.

05:51.330 --> 05:57.710
<b>Chomp chomp</b>

05:54.480 --> 05:56.030
I have no choice.

05:56.030 --> 05:57.710
Energy, huh?

05:58.200 --> 06:01.740
And one day, you'll be Chubby Lily.

06:02.290 --> 06:04.880
What's this? I can't see my lower body.

06:04.880 --> 06:06.050
<i><b>Smack</b></i>

06:06.050 --> 06:07.220
I heard that!

06:07.220 --> 06:11.540
How dare you talk to your savior that way!

06:08.040 --> 06:10.720
You heard nothing! Nothing!

06:13.720 --> 06:15.370
Hang on a second!

06:15.370 --> 06:16.890
I felt something bad.

06:17.510 --> 06:19.980
You think you can distract me that easily?!

06:21.860 --> 06:23.610
What was that? A demon?

06:24.080 --> 06:26.070
It does feel dangerous.

06:26.600 --> 06:28.040
It's nearby, isn't it?

06:28.540 --> 06:30.470
Amidst all these people...

06:35.720 --> 06:38.000
Akkun's on a date!

06:38.000 --> 06:39.960
On a date with Lily-chan!

06:39.960 --> 06:42.220
On a happy date!

06:42.220 --> 06:46.340
Akkun's on a date! On a date with Lily-chan!

06:46.660 --> 06:48.040
What should we do?

06:48.040 --> 06:49.990
Hirota-kun's crying.

06:50.980 --> 06:54.510
Should we... invite him inside?

06:54.510 --> 06:56.890
S-Sir!

06:57.360 --> 07:01.360
Man, I had the wrong idea!

07:01.360 --> 07:05.070
So you were just showing him 
around town, huh, Lily-chan?

07:05.070 --> 07:06.750
Y-Yeah.

07:06.750 --> 07:08.840
Don't be such a stranger, Akkun.

07:08.840 --> 07:11.450
I would have given you a tour 
if you'd just asked.

07:11.450 --> 07:13.240
Yeah... Sorry.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.760
It's all good.

07:15.570 --> 07:19.500
Man, I saw you two meeting up in town,

07:19.800 --> 07:23.280
so I couldn't help but send jealous vibes.

07:23.280 --> 07:25.960
<i>So that first glare was from him, too.</i>

07:25.960 --> 07:28.410
<i>It was just a jealous stare, huh?</i>

07:28.410 --> 07:31.160
So, what were you doing, anyway?

07:31.160 --> 07:33.240
You could have said something.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.720
I was just hanging out with someone.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.800
Huh.

07:38.800 --> 07:39.680
Where are they now?

07:39.680 --> 07:42.200
I snuck away to say hi to you two, so...

07:42.200 --> 07:44.790
Shoot, I'd better get going!

07:46.230 --> 07:47.770
Kensaku!

07:48.250 --> 07:50.940
Don't wander off like that!

07:50.940 --> 07:52.650
I was looking for you.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.140
Yuka.

07:54.140 --> 07:55.280
Sorry.

07:55.640 --> 07:58.590
You promised you'd
spend the day with me today.

07:58.590 --> 08:00.330
Who are these two?

08:00.600 --> 08:02.720
I-I'll introduce you.

08:02.720 --> 08:04.830
We're all in the same class.

08:05.650 --> 08:07.590
This one's Amane Lily-chan.

08:08.290 --> 08:09.480
Nice to meet you.

08:09.480 --> 08:10.960
What's up with this shrimp?

08:12.340 --> 08:16.330
Oh, is she the girl you're always talking about?

08:16.330 --> 08:17.980
I thought she was in grade school.

08:17.980 --> 08:20.100
Wh-What's that supposed to mean?!

08:20.100 --> 08:21.150
That's so rude!

08:21.150 --> 08:23.430
I just said what I meant.

08:24.560 --> 08:27.140
<i>I'll wreck you!</i>

08:24.600 --> 08:26.560
<b>Ngahhhh</b>

08:27.140 --> 08:29.290
N-Nice to meet you.

08:30.440 --> 08:33.130
And this is Akutsu Masatora.

08:33.130 --> 08:34.800
I call him Akkun.

08:34.800 --> 08:35.990
Hello.

08:35.990 --> 08:38.450
Thump-thump-thump

08:36.350 --> 08:37.740
Uh-huh.

08:37.740 --> 08:39.020
Sure, nice to meet you.

08:39.020 --> 08:39.520
Whew.

08:39.520 --> 08:42.250
So, Hirota-kun, what about her?

08:42.250 --> 08:44.350
She's Tanahashi Yuka.

08:44.350 --> 08:45.530
She's my childhood frie—

08:45.530 --> 08:46.630
I'm his girlfriend.

08:46.630 --> 08:47.360
What?!

08:47.360 --> 08:48.470
What are you talking about?!

08:48.960 --> 08:50.300
You got a problem with that?

08:50.300 --> 08:51.480
Wait, hang on!

08:51.480 --> 08:53.260
That's not good, Hirota-kun.

08:53.260 --> 08:56.130
You have such an adorable girlfriend.

08:56.130 --> 08:58.910
You shouldn't have confessed to me <i>four times</i>.

08:58.910 --> 09:01.020
Or was it five?

09:02.620 --> 09:03.590
Lily...

09:04.360 --> 09:05.300
Ex...

09:06.520 --> 09:08.380
Explain yourself!

09:08.380 --> 09:10.440
I don't know what to say!

09:10.440 --> 09:11.870
Come on, let's go!

09:11.870 --> 09:13.100
Ow, ow, ow!

09:13.100 --> 09:15.800
Wow, that was nasty.

09:16.810 --> 09:19.450
You didn't need to pour fuel on the fire.

09:19.450 --> 09:23.020
She needed to be punished for insulting me.

09:23.020 --> 09:24.790
She got what she deserved.

09:23.870 --> 09:25.080
<b>Hey,
don't
do
that!</b>

09:25.220 --> 09:26.710
And what's wrong with you?

09:26.710 --> 09:29.560
You've been awful silent.

09:29.560 --> 09:31.880
<i>I don't feel anything anymore.</i>

09:31.880 --> 09:35.610
<i>Was it really just Hirota's jealousy 
that I've been sensing, then?</i>

09:40.000 --> 09:41.270
We're done.

09:42.220 --> 09:43.920
We're done for today.

09:43.920 --> 09:45.140
I'm tired.

09:45.830 --> 09:47.880
Notify me as soon as you detect something.

09:47.880 --> 09:49.980
Hide it from me, and you'll be sorry.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.600
Sure, whatever.

09:57.380 --> 10:00.790
Also, would you mind 
paying for your own coffee?

10:01.990 --> 10:04.310
You've already been paid for.

10:04.310 --> 10:05.560
She's being manly!

10:07.730 --> 10:09.630
You've finally shown yourself.

10:11.460 --> 10:14.040
How about I humiliate you, too?

10:14.040 --> 10:16.880
And then I'll exorcise you slowly, painfully.

10:22.350 --> 10:24.350
Morning!

10:29.160 --> 10:30.990
<i>Why is </i>she<i> here?</i>

10:30.990 --> 10:32.940
Sorry about yesterday.

10:32.940 --> 10:36.200
I got worked up over such a <i>small</i> thing.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.590
I seem to have made a <i>little</i> mistake.

10:38.590 --> 10:40.800
Over something really <i>tiny</i>.

10:40.800 --> 10:42.570
It's totally fine.

10:42.570 --> 10:43.950
I'm sorry, too.

10:43.950 --> 10:47.370
I shouldn't have caused a misunderstanding.

10:47.370 --> 10:50.190
Oh, it's fine. I was just kidding.

10:50.190 --> 10:52.750
We're really just childhood friends.

10:52.750 --> 10:56.510
Oh, yeah, my class is next door, actually.

10:56.510 --> 10:58.540
Let's be friends.

10:59.840 --> 11:02.430
Yeah, I look forward to it.

11:03.910 --> 11:06.170
Can I call you Lily-chan, too?

11:06.170 --> 11:07.390
The way Kensaku does.

11:08.450 --> 11:09.200
Yeah.

11:09.200 --> 11:11.690
I'll call you Yuka-chan, too.

11:12.090 --> 11:13.420
Sure.

11:13.420 --> 11:15.440
Well, I'd better head back.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.940
Bye.

11:19.740 --> 11:22.040
She kept saying "small" and "tiny" and stuff.

11:22.040 --> 11:23.230
It was deliberate.

11:23.230 --> 11:24.910
That was totally deliberate.

11:24.910 --> 11:27.040
I'll crush her.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.660
I'll crush her!

11:33.260 --> 11:36.040
She said the same thing that day, too.

11:36.040 --> 11:37.870
I lost my temper, and...

11:37.870 --> 11:42.470
I humiliated him plenty 
before I exorcised him slowly.

11:44.280 --> 11:46.140
Oh, there you are.

11:46.140 --> 11:47.390
Akkun!

11:47.390 --> 11:48.920
We were looking for you.

11:48.920 --> 11:51.270
You weren't in class or the cafeteria.

11:51.270 --> 11:53.300
Oh, yeah, you know.

11:53.860 --> 11:55.000
What's up?

11:55.400 --> 11:58.350
Are you not feeling well today, Akutsu-kun?

11:58.350 --> 11:59.940
We're here to listen if you need it.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.460
Guys...

12:01.960 --> 12:06.660
<i>Not that I can tell them what Amane really is.</i>

12:07.850 --> 12:10.290
<i>Looks like I'm not getting out of this one.</i>

12:10.790 --> 12:14.740
<i>And I don't want to tell Hirota that it's 
Amane showing up in my dreams...</i>

12:15.170 --> 12:17.580
<i>I'm gonna have to talk my way out of this.</i>

12:18.150 --> 12:23.850
Actually, this older woman I know 
keeps showing up in my dreams lately,

12:23.850 --> 12:25.890
and I'm having a hard time sleeping.

12:26.290 --> 12:28.310
Does he mean...

12:28.880 --> 12:31.020
You're in love?

12:31.020 --> 12:31.820
Huh?!

12:31.820 --> 12:32.980
I'm obviously not!

12:35.630 --> 12:37.110
What are you laughing for?!

12:37.940 --> 12:39.500
Yeah, Hirota!

12:39.500 --> 12:42.580
That's rude to Akutsu-kun!

12:42.580 --> 12:45.420
I mean, you can't sleep because 
she's showing up in your dreams?

12:45.420 --> 12:46.660
What are you, a middle schooler?

12:47.170 --> 12:51.000
Sorry, Akutsu-kun, I just 
didn't expect that from you.

12:51.480 --> 12:53.960
I didn't expect an older lady, either.

12:53.960 --> 12:56.700
I totally thought it'd be Lily-chan.

12:57.440 --> 12:59.930
We'd have been crush buddies.

12:59.930 --> 13:01.580
Crush buddies?

13:01.580 --> 13:04.090
Wouldn't that just make things awkward?

13:05.300 --> 13:06.670
No way.

13:06.670 --> 13:09.510
Who cares who anyone falls in love with, right?

13:09.770 --> 13:11.930
But you need dating advice, then, huh?

13:11.930 --> 13:13.850
I don't know if I can be helpful at all.

13:13.850 --> 13:16.550
I've never gone out with anyone before.

13:17.160 --> 13:18.590
What about that girl from yesterday?

13:18.590 --> 13:20.350
She's just a childhood friend.

13:20.350 --> 13:22.380
I was just tagging along with her shopping.

13:22.380 --> 13:23.960
Oh, really?

13:23.960 --> 13:26.030
I'm actually surprised, though.

13:26.030 --> 13:28.910
I heard you've been 
hitting on people left and right.

13:28.910 --> 13:31.470
He does get pretty far each time.

13:31.470 --> 13:33.200
I do...

13:33.830 --> 13:35.620
I get cold really easily.

13:35.960 --> 13:37.180
No way.

13:37.180 --> 13:38.120
I'm serious.

13:38.120 --> 13:39.160
Try touching me.

13:40.680 --> 13:43.820
You're right, you're so cold.

13:46.130 --> 13:47.880
I'm sorry!

13:49.200 --> 13:51.050
And that's how it goes.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.700
I see.

13:52.700 --> 13:55.310
Why don't you date Tanahashi, then?

13:56.980 --> 13:58.780
I have my reasons.

14:01.280 --> 14:04.090
<i>Shit, his life force is draining out of him.</i>

14:06.490 --> 14:12.740
We're going demon
hunting later today

14:06.490 --> 14:12.740
m 0 0 l 185 0 l 185 70 l 0 70

14:09.610 --> 14:12.740
I have a tummy ache

14:09.610 --> 14:12.740
m 0 0 l 185 0 l 185 40 l 0 40

14:15.140 --> 14:16.030
Sheesh.

14:16.030 --> 14:19.150
I'm having such a hard time finding demons.

14:19.150 --> 14:21.960
It would be so much easier 
if I had my radar around.

14:22.440 --> 14:25.540
<i>Things would be so much easier 
without this damn thing...</i>

14:29.920 --> 14:33.350
Two hours of walking around 
and nothing to show for it.

14:33.350 --> 14:36.940
Damn it, can't I just extract his radar powers?

14:37.350 --> 14:38.600
Akutsu

14:37.350 --> 14:38.600
Did you eat something
off the floor?

14:38.600 --> 14:40.570
Whatcha doing?

14:42.530 --> 14:44.730
Huh? Are you here alone?

14:44.730 --> 14:46.730
<i>Not her again...</i>

14:47.840 --> 14:50.110
<i>And why is she sitting next to me?</i>

14:50.760 --> 14:53.310
Oh, just wandering around.

14:53.310 --> 14:54.700
What about you, Yuka-chan?

14:54.700 --> 14:56.920
Wandering around by myself, too.

14:56.920 --> 14:59.450
I was with Kensaku before.

14:59.450 --> 15:01.040
Y-You were, huh?

15:01.480 --> 15:04.380
Hey, what are you up to later?

15:04.380 --> 15:06.760
I'm thinking of wandering 
around for a bit longer.

15:07.680 --> 15:08.920
I know, I know!

15:08.920 --> 15:09.930
Why don't we hang out?

15:11.220 --> 15:13.240
It's no fun being on our own.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.850
We may as well have fun.

15:14.850 --> 15:16.050
Right?

15:16.050 --> 15:18.730
<i>What is she scheming?</i>

15:18.730 --> 15:23.540
<i>Though, I'd rather avoid friction with 
the humans as much as possible.</i>

15:23.540 --> 15:25.610
<i>Which means I'll have to...</i>

15:25.610 --> 15:27.770
Sure, let's go.

15:27.770 --> 15:28.860
Yay!

15:28.860 --> 15:30.280
Let's go look at clothes.

15:35.600 --> 15:36.940
Isn't this cute?

15:36.940 --> 15:38.450
It kinda is.

15:38.450 --> 15:39.630
Right?

15:39.630 --> 15:40.810
So...

15:40.810 --> 15:42.080
Off you go!

15:42.660 --> 15:44.970
Let me know when you're done.

15:44.970 --> 15:46.490
<i>What does she think she's doing?</i>

15:46.490 --> 15:49.580
<i>Is she trying to make amends with me?</i>

15:49.990 --> 15:51.590
She could have just said so.

15:57.600 --> 15:58.940
Sorry.

15:58.940 --> 16:01.230
It wasn't your size, was it?

16:01.230 --> 16:02.360
<i>I see.</i>

16:02.360 --> 16:04.150
<i>She's waging war!</i>

16:04.150 --> 16:06.000
I'll get changed.

16:06.000 --> 16:07.000
Yeah.

16:08.840 --> 16:10.620
<i>I see, I see.</i>

16:10.620 --> 16:13.340
<i>She's going to mock me, no matter what.</i>

16:14.630 --> 16:16.200
This one looks cute.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.280
Oh, yeah.

16:17.280 --> 16:21.790
I think it would look better 
on you than on me, though.

16:21.790 --> 16:22.860
Wanna try it on?

16:22.860 --> 16:24.800
Y-You think so?

16:24.800 --> 16:26.920
It's 56 cm around the waist.

16:26.920 --> 16:28.630
It might be too big on me.

16:28.630 --> 16:31.380
You're slim, though, so it should be all right.

16:32.880 --> 16:34.630
<b>Judgment rendered!</b>

16:33.160 --> 16:34.630
Judgment rendered!

16:36.230 --> 16:37.920
<i>Foolish woman!</i>

16:37.920 --> 16:40.030
<i>You must have thought 
you hit me where it hurts...</i>

16:40.030 --> 16:41.890
<i>But you didn't expect retaliation!</i>

16:41.890 --> 16:43.710
It's 56 cm.

16:43.710 --> 16:45.640
It's about the size of a kid's cap.

16:45.640 --> 16:47.650
No problem. It'll fit you.

16:47.650 --> 16:50.980
<i>Yes. It's an angel that you're fighting against.</i>

16:50.980 --> 16:52.640
<i>I can easily pretend to be an honest,</i>

16:52.640 --> 16:55.690
<i>simple character as I expertly 
manipulate your psychology.</i>

16:55.690 --> 16:57.490
<i>Such an angel I am!</i>

16:57.490 --> 17:00.760
M-Maybe we should get going. Okay?

17:00.760 --> 17:01.620
Okay!

17:04.660 --> 17:05.460
Shape up your tummy!

17:04.660 --> 17:05.460
Gives you nice curves

17:07.710 --> 17:08.750
<b>Family Life</b>

17:07.710 --> 17:08.750
<b>Getting
Your
Child
to
Grow</b>

17:15.550 --> 17:16.930
Yet, they bought them

17:17.380 --> 17:19.010
Where should we go next?

17:19.320 --> 17:20.400
Huh?

17:20.400 --> 17:21.860
Actually...

17:22.640 --> 17:24.430
Are your parents strict about your curfew?

17:24.430 --> 17:27.130
Nah, I still have time.

17:28.270 --> 17:30.770
Let's end the day with that, then.

17:30.770 --> 17:32.460
What do you do there?

17:32.460 --> 17:33.740
You don't know?

17:33.740 --> 17:35.720
I've only heard of it.

17:37.170 --> 17:39.660
Wanna try it out, then?

17:40.080 --> 17:41.160
Okay.

17:44.330 --> 17:46.300
Come on, what's with the face?

17:46.300 --> 17:48.540
I-I'm just nervous.

17:48.540 --> 17:51.130
I guess it's okay. We can take more.

17:51.130 --> 17:53.840
Okay, time to draw.

17:53.840 --> 17:55.400
There's plenty of stickers and stuff, too.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.780
Do whatever you want.

17:56.780 --> 17:57.800
Here's the pen.

17:58.280 --> 17:59.510
Thanks.

17:59.800 --> 18:02.180
<i>She really is a beginner.</i>

18:03.090 --> 18:06.430
<i>I'll make her first purikura memory 
a memory of blood.</i>

18:07.570 --> 18:09.190
Like this?

18:09.970 --> 18:11.300
It disappeared!

18:11.890 --> 18:13.730
<i>This is amusing.</i>

18:14.040 --> 18:16.110
Huh? Where are the stickers?

18:16.110 --> 18:18.530
<i>Maybe I shouldn't.</i>

18:21.660 --> 18:23.160
Hey, are you there?

18:22.030 --> 18:23.160
Answer me, servant

18:22.530 --> 18:23.160
Are you staying put in bed?

18:29.880 --> 18:31.540
What are you grinning about?

18:31.540 --> 18:33.380
Where should I stick them?

18:34.180 --> 18:36.240
Wait, maybe it'll be a waste if I use them.

18:36.240 --> 18:37.420
What should I do?

18:37.420 --> 18:38.990
It's not a big deal.

18:38.990 --> 18:40.590
Just put them on your notebook or something.

18:40.590 --> 18:42.840
<i>Oh, man, what the heck?</i>

18:42.840 --> 18:44.750
<i>She's so adorable.</i>

18:44.750 --> 18:46.470
<i>What's up with this small mammal?</i>

18:46.470 --> 18:48.240
How about on my phone?

18:48.240 --> 18:50.440
They might get messed up right away, though.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.200
<i>That one's devastating!</i>

18:52.200 --> 18:53.400
<i>Especially for a guy.</i>

18:53.740 --> 18:57.900
By the way, why did you invite me to hang out?

18:58.790 --> 19:00.990
It's more fun than being on your own, isn't it?

19:01.890 --> 19:05.050
Also, I was hoping I'd get to 
chat with you properly.

19:05.050 --> 19:06.700
You know what they say:

19:06.700 --> 19:10.000
To defeat the enemy, 
you must know them first.

19:10.300 --> 19:11.870
Enemy?

19:12.480 --> 19:14.250
<i>Oh, it's about that idiot.</i>

19:14.250 --> 19:15.300
Oh?

19:15.300 --> 19:18.810
And I was like, ah, you're 
definitely the type that guys like.

19:18.810 --> 19:20.550
You're the exact opposite of me.

19:21.380 --> 19:24.430
I don't want to lose, though.

19:25.200 --> 19:31.000
It's only been a day, but after 
I talked to you, I realized...

19:31.000 --> 19:33.560
Maybe we'd get along pretty well.

19:33.560 --> 19:37.180
Although I don't know how you feel about it.

19:37.180 --> 19:38.940
I-I...

19:39.760 --> 19:42.650
I had fun, too.

19:43.250 --> 19:44.450
Great!

19:44.720 --> 19:46.780
<i>That's the truth.</i>

19:46.780 --> 19:50.120
<i>Sparring with her has been a unique sensation.</i>

19:50.730 --> 19:53.930
<i>Nothing like talking 
with the other girls in class.</i>

19:53.930 --> 19:56.340
<i>It was strangely comfortable.</i>

19:56.600 --> 19:57.740
Oh, that reminds me.

19:57.740 --> 20:02.460
Just to be clear, 
I have no feelings for Hirota-kun.

20:02.460 --> 20:03.980
Oh, I thought so.

20:03.980 --> 20:06.910
So Kensaku was just going off on his own.

20:06.910 --> 20:09.180
Sorry for freaking out.

20:09.180 --> 20:10.270
It's all right.

20:10.620 --> 20:14.520
Although, as a woman, 
I do still feel competitive.

20:14.830 --> 20:17.250
You're pretty feminine.

20:17.250 --> 20:19.480
I-I'm not, really.

20:19.480 --> 20:21.010
You're cute, right?

20:21.010 --> 20:22.200
You're classy, right?

20:22.200 --> 20:23.840
You're smart, right?

20:23.840 --> 20:25.370
You have long eyelashes, right?

20:25.370 --> 20:27.330
And a good figure.

20:27.330 --> 20:29.900
<i>Maybe she's not all that bad.</i>

20:33.910 --> 20:35.750
Oh, crap.

20:35.750 --> 20:36.910
What's wrong?

20:36.910 --> 20:39.130
I have to be somewhere soon.

20:39.130 --> 20:40.720
Sorry, I should get going.

20:40.720 --> 20:42.880
Oh, I'll take care of the table.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.030
Thanks.

20:44.030 --> 20:45.260
In return...

20:45.520 --> 20:47.010
You can have this.

20:46.160 --> 20:47.010
Strawberry milk flavor

20:46.160 --> 20:47.010
<b>Senovil</b>

20:46.160 --> 20:47.010
<b>Aids\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hgrowth</b>

20:47.310 --> 20:48.260
Later.

20:51.910 --> 20:54.590
<i>She got me good in the end.</i>

20:54.590 --> 20:57.020
<i>I didn't expect that.</i>

20:58.400 --> 21:00.150
<b>My First
 Purikura</b>

21:00.150 --> 21:04.550
Then again, I ought to forgive her 
in light of the good time she gave me today.

21:05.400 --> 21:06.910
Also....

21:06.910 --> 21:09.660
I'm fine now.
Where are you?

21:07.260 --> 21:08.480
<i>I'm fine now.</i>

21:08.480 --> 21:09.660
<i>Where are you?</i>

21:09.660 --> 21:11.280
<i>You're an angel!</i>

21:11.280 --> 21:13.200
<i>You're an angel, aren't you?</i>

21:13.200 --> 21:17.710
Fine. Stay in bed for today

21:13.200 --> 21:17.710
Take your medicine

21:13.200 --> 21:17.710
And contact me when you're better

21:13.470 --> 21:15.710
<i>Fine. Stay in bed for today.</i>

21:15.710 --> 21:17.340
<i>Take your medicine.</i>

21:17.710 --> 21:20.340
<i>Don't go worrying for me!</i>

21:29.990 --> 21:32.020
My stomach started feeling better.

21:32.350 --> 21:34.520
You could have just used this.

21:34.520 --> 21:36.220
I mean, yeah, but...

21:37.280 --> 21:39.020
You can't bring yourself to lie, can you?

21:41.540 --> 21:44.750
Take me to the demon I'm sure you sense.

21:44.750 --> 21:47.030
Oh, but first, I must get changed.

21:47.380 --> 21:48.910
Wait here.

21:50.390 --> 21:51.850
Not here...

21:51.850 --> 21:53.690
Nowhere to be found...

21:53.690 --> 21:54.660
Where is it?

21:54.660 --> 21:56.110
Oh?

21:56.110 --> 21:57.540
You really were here.

21:58.080 --> 21:59.880
Who are you?

22:00.630 --> 22:03.520
The one who brings harm to the tainted.

22:03.520 --> 22:06.900
Your sworn enemy.
